OL,3,AUS father and son arrested after
OL,4,Asuspected kratom drug deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS prosecutors charged Yahya Mohamed
OL,7,FMosleh, 51, and Islam Yahya Mosleh, 18,
OL,8,Ffor possession with the intent to
OL,9,Fdistribute controlled substances in
OL,10,Fconnection with the death investigation
OL,11,Fof two Ole Miss students last month.
OL,13,FAlthough their deaths have not
OL,14,Fofficially been attributed to kratom,
OL,15,Fofficials afterward issued warnings
OL,16,Fabout consuming kratom.
